        "id": "build_companion_pages",
        "instruction": "Do not create or edit a sibling repository from this single-repository hybrid node. Use bd to create or update one explicit external follow-up for the separately versioned companion gateway and application, including the target repository, companion.wit hash, generated-client boundary, local authentication, HTTP/3 with HTTP/2 fallback, strict CSP, request limits, redaction, the four project/daily-root/health/worker-memory pages, typed TaskIntent constraints, unit and accessibility gates, and exact completion commands. Record machine-readable handoff evidence in build/evidence/external-companion-followup.json with repository availability, observed read-only revision when available, linked Beads issue, required checks, and a precise blocker or external commit. Do not write outside controlplane and do not add any UI or browser-serving file here.",
